  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'sterling-silver-navajo-pearl-saucer-necklace-with-stamped-shotgun-shell-barrel-b', '4324957696', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4324957696/navajo-pearl-necklace-shotgun-shell?click_key=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%3ALTe9b5bd3da7f80c1c62a374315997cf452bb1b2eb&click_sum=36edd93d&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-729084-8-10&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&cns=1&sts=1&content_source=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%253ALTe9b5bd3da7f80c1c62a374315997cf452bb1b2eb',
   'Sterling Silver Navajo Pearl & Saucer Necklace with Stamped Shotgun Shell Barrel Bead • Native American Jewelry.', 'Elevate your jewelry collection with this striking, unisex sterling silver necklace. This piece beautifully marries classic Southwestern heritage with a rugged, modern edge. It features a seamless blend of genuine round Navajo pearls and unique saucer beads, perfectly framing a detailed shotgun shell barrel bead that is stamped with traditional Native American designs. Designed to be versatile, this necklace looks incredible as a standalone statement piece or stacked alongside your favorite Southwestern and Native American jewelry. Complete the Look Looking for a full matching set? Pair this necklace with the coordinating Sterling Silver Navajo Pearl & Shotgun Shell Barrel Bead Bracelet or our Traditional Stamped Silver Dangle Earrings to complete your authentic Southwestern look! Please note: Matching items are sold separately in the shop here: https://www.etsy.com/shop/FlowMotionsCreations?ref=listing&search_query=Barrel+Bead Product Details • Material: 100% genuine .925 sterling silver (all beads, accents, and components). • Navajo Pearls: Ranging from 1/8” to 1/4” in diameter (4mm-6mm). • Shotgun Shell Bead: Approximately 3/4” wide with authentic stamped traditional detailing. • Style: Fully unisex design, making it a perfect fit and look for anyone. • Closure: Secured with a premium sterling silver spring ring clasp for added safety and everyday durability. • Quantity: Listing is for one (1) necklace in the specific length you select. Sizing & Style Guide Because this piece is unisex, choosing the right length helps achieve your perfect look: 16” – 18”: Ideal base-layer or choker length for women; a fitted, collarbone-length look for men. 20” – 22”: The classic, standard everyday length for men; a relaxed, mid-chest plunge for women. 24”: A long, deep statement length that sits comfortably over hoodies or heavy winter layers for both. Please select your desired length from the drop-down menu. Care Instructions The rich contrast comes from the intentional oxidat', 'statement-pieces',
