  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'navajo-handmade-earrings', '4570979118', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4570979118/navajo-handmade-earrings?click_key=EuAGqaHVhY1NZyPS66SQ7bHMrZc5%3ALT585feab91bd8e828d80626d7e979fa4e1b3384bd&click_sum=aa0d8868&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-729083-8-8&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&sts=1',
   'Navajo Handmade Earrings', 'These Navajo Earrings are quite different. I''m not sure of the name of the stones but I''ve been told they might be Rhodonite. Whatever they are, they are certainly beautiful. The earrings are 2" long with the ear wires. They weigh 13.9 grams. The hallmark is BJ for Navajo Benjamin James. They are also marked Sterling. I''ve never seen stones like these and I wish I knew what they are, but I was unable to find out. These earrings are beautifully made. They are so very pretty and most importantly-very, very feminine. I''m sure they''ll be someone''s favorite.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
