  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'vintage-navajo-sterling-silver-men-s-ring-with-natural-turquoise-26-8g-size-11-s', '4612159624', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4612159624/vintage-navajo-sterling-silver-mens-ring?click_key=EuAGqaHVhY1NZyPS66SQ7bHMrZc5%3ALTe14cc3df7a6049a01bfe557c0e857c0ad7e7bd3f&click_sum=8f2f2a4f&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-729083-8-5&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1',
   'Vintage Navajo Sterling Silver Men''s Ring with Natural Turquoise – 26.8g, Size 11, Southwestern Native American Jewelry', 'Beautiful vintage Navajo men’s ring featuring a natural turquoise stone set in sterling silver. This Southwestern piece has a bold, distinctive design that makes it a wonderful addition to any vintage Native American jewelry collection. Item Details: * Style: Vintage Navajo * Jewelry Type: Men’s Ring * Metal: Sterling Silver * Stone: Natural Turquoise * Weight: 26.8 grams * Ring Size: 11 * Setting Measurements: 1.2 x 1.1 inches DISCLOSURE: ALL ITEMS SOLD AS IS AS PICTURED. ITEMS MAY HAVE SCRATCHES OR DENTS SINCE THEY ARE USED VINTAGE SOLD AS IS.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
