  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'dainty-turquoise-sterling-silver-hoop-earrings-conch-cartilage-ring', '1121785357', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/1121785357/dainty-turquoise-sterling-silver-hoop?click_key=Euw6IXeiMqc8FSnM8soEPdaJMGe5%3ALT37e28d6a3bae6cd259bc6ee8cf1e937520202603&click_sum=6c3540f1&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-387153-20-10&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&pop=1',
   'Dainty Turquoise Sterling Silver Hoop Earrings: Conch Cartilage Ring', 'Pinar Jewelry Huggie Solid Hoop Collection. ​These classic huggie hoop earrings are perfect for everyday wear. Great for stacking along other hoops or post earrings. A modern look that is thick yet sleek. Available in silver, rose gold or gold and can be purchased as a pair or single earring. Perfect for those who like dainty jewelry but still want a little bit of flair. SPECIFICATIONS ____________________ • Style: Pierced Hoop • Sold in: Pair • Metal: Sterling silver • Metal stamp: 925 • Finish: High polish • Clasp: Easy click-in mechanism • Gauge: 0.6 mm • Earring thickness: 1.9 mm wide • Inner Hoop diameter: 6 sizes available - 5 mm, 6 mm, 7 mm 8 mm, 9 mm, 10 mm • Comfortable design & can be worn daily • Nickel Free & Lightweight, perfect for everyday wear All Pinar Jewelry products come with a Gift pouch. Ready to gift to your loved ones. Please check our shop for many other exciting pieces. Pinar means a water spring or fountain in Turkish. Established in May of 2018, Pinar Jewelry has sprung from providing fashion and vogue clothing for women to further accent their beauty with affordable fine jewelry. The Family Like our name, our family-run business origins come from the Mediterranean country of Turkey, bringing with us the experiences of the Grand Bazaar of dazzling delights to here in Manassas and to all of Northern Virginia. Our namesake, too, derives from freshwater that comes out from the earth with no reason but to give a chance to those in need. Founded by Pinar, and inspired by her country, she turned her eye for fashionable beauty towards starting her own small business. We seek then to bring you enchanting jewelry, a little action that could inspire you with opportunities. Production partners PinarJewelry makes this item with help from Jewelry design partner, New Brunswick, NJ', 'turquoise-jewelry',
