  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'turquoise-baroque-pearl-necklace-turquoise-pendant-necklace-december-birthstone-', '4302009901', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4302009901/turquoise-baroque-pearl-necklace?click_key=Euw6IXeiMqc8FSnM8soEPdaJMGe5%3ALTb610cf7d890f067d363f141205e4da68770363a8&click_sum=2f88065b&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-387153-20-9&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&sts=1',
   'Turquoise Baroque Pearl Necklace, Turquoise Pendant Necklace, December Birthstone Jewelry, Boho Gemstone Necklace, Handmade Gift', '💖 DESCRIPTION Channel elegance and bohemian soul with this handcrafted Turquoise & Baroque Pearl Statement Necklace a striking piece made to elevate any look. Featuring genuine turquoise gemstones (December''s birthstone) and natural baroque freshwater pearls, this design captures the vibrant energy of the sea and the serenity of nature. The centerpiece a bold, gold framed turquoise pendant makes this necklace the perfect gift for someone who loves timeless beauty with a modern twist. Whether you''re looking for a meaningful birthday gift, a unique bridal statement piece, or a vacation-ready accessory, this necklace delivers elegance with soul. ✨ Details: • December Birthstone: Turquoise Symbol of protection, calm, and positivity • Natural Baroque Freshwater Pearls • 22K Gold-Plated Brass Accents • Statement Turquoise Pendant with Gold Frame • Handmade with love 🎁 Ships in an elegant gift box – ready to gift, ready to shine. 💡 Perfect for: Birthdays · Brides · Beach Weddings · Vacations · Boho Queens · Stylish Souls 💖 ABOUT OUR SHIPPING • Shipping Time: Orders are typically shipped within 5 days and delivered to you in 2-5 business days, depending on the destination. • Packaging Quality: We use high quality, eco-friendly packaging to ensure your jewelry arrives safely and beautifully. • Tracking: We strive to provide tracking information, but shipping policies may vary depending on your region and the courier. Please note that the responsibility for tracking lies with the customer. • Regional Differences: Shipping times and policies may differ depending on the courier and destination region. • Customer Support: If you encounter any issues with your shipment, we recommend contacting the courier’s customer service directly for assistance. 💖 FOLLOW US Stay tuned for new designs and exclusive updates! • Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/majesticmoonatelier • Pinterest: https://tr.pinterest.com/majesticmoonatelier 💖 RETURN AND REFUND POLICY • Commitment to Quality', 'statement-pieces',
